        "text": "Page: Regency Road, Adelaide. Sentence: Located approximately 6 km north of the city centre, it spans from Arndale Shopping Centre, Kilkenny in the west, to Broadview in the east, continuing eastwards as Muller Road, to end at North East Road in Klemzig.\nPage: Klemzig, South Australia. Sentence: Klemzig is a suburb of Adelaide in the City of Port Adelaide Enfield.\nPage: Dudley Park, South Australia. Sentence: The suburb is bordered by Regency Road (north), Simpson Avenue (south), the Adelaide-Gawler railway line (east), and a line directly north-south from the Harrison Road-Simpson Avenue intersection to Regency Road (west).\nPage: Electoral district of Croydon (South Australia). Sentence: Besides Croydon, it includes Allenby Gardens, Beverley, Brompton, Bowden, West Croydon, Croydon Park, Devon Park, Dudley Park, Flinders Park, Hindmarsh, West Hindmarsh, Kilkenny, Renown Park, Ridleyton, Welland, Woodville Gardens, Woodville Park and parts of Ferryden Park.",
